{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04770","headline":"送赵二尚书彦昭北伐 · 张说","name":"送赵二尚书彦昭北伐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虏地河冰合，边城备此时。\n兵连紫塞路，将举白云司。\n提劒荣中贵，衔珠盛出师。\n日华光组练，风色焰旌旗。\n投笔尊前起，横戈马上辞。\n梅花吹别引，杨柳赋归诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}